Do you have a magic whistle in order to keep your Solar close any time
you get into trouble?

Since your priest is chaotic, you might wish for the Bat from Hell, one
of the best artifacts, making you largely independent of the protection
by your Solar. It is not an intelligent artifact, nor a quest one, so it
should not blast you.

Yes, it is a good idea to keep at least one wish for the item you will
not get from Sokoban. If you get the BOH there, you might wish for SDSM
in addition to your cloak of MR. In the long run, I would always prefer
the DSM to the robe.

If you do not have poison resistance yet, a ring of poison resistance or
else (if you have a towel ready) a blessed tin of green dragon meat
might be a good early wish.






